Ayo, lihat.

01:54:29.562 --> 01:54:31.598
Sampai kering begini karena spermaku.

01:54:32.565 --> 01:54:33.566
Ayo.

01:54:39.038 --> 01:54:40.039
Ayo, lihatlah.

01:54:41.674 --> 01:54:42.609
Jangan memalingkan wajah.

01:54:42.709 --> 01:54:44.310
Ayo.

01:55:14.173 --> 01:55:15.942
Boleh ya mendesah mesum seperti itu?

01:55:17.477 --> 01:55:19.445
Nanti dikira kita sedang macam-macam.

01:55:20.013 --> 01:55:21.014
Oleh orang tuamu.

01:56:00.219 --> 01:56:02.588
Kalau kau, cepatlah...

01:56:08.261 --> 01:56:09.262
Segera berlutut.

01:56:12.865 --> 01:56:14.667
Lihat baik-baik saat penisku masuk.

01:56:31.951 --> 01:56:32.986
Rasanya enak, lho.

01:56:50.403 --> 01:56:53.973
Ada ponsel di saku celanaku, ambilkan.

01:56:54.907 --> 01:56:55.842
Ponselnya.

01:56:55.975 --> 01:56:56.976
Ambilkan.

01:56:57.543 --> 01:56:59.078
Cepatlah.

01:57:07.920 --> 01:57:08.921
Sini, berikan padaku.

01:57:26.406 --> 01:57:27.407
Ambil saja.

01:57:29.409 --> 01:57:30.476
Kau sudah tahu, kan?

01:57:32.211 --> 01:57:33.212
Lagi lihat apa?

01:57:33.679 --> 01:57:34.680
Ayo.

01:57:35.181 --> 01:57:36.182
Nih.

01:57:37.617 --> 01:57:38.751
Ambil dari saku.

01:57:43.923 --> 01:57:44.924
Cepat ambil.

01:57:57.203 --> 01:57:57.937
Ayo, terus.

01:57:58.237 --> 01:57:59.238
Tadi diarahkan ke atas, kan?

01:58:11.818 --> 01:58:12.819
Lagi ngapain, sih?

01:58:13.719 --> 01:58:14.720
Ulurkan tanganmu.

01:58:17.123 --> 01:58:18.424
Rekam pas lagi dimasukin.

01:58:20.960 --> 01:58:21.961
Rekam dulu.

01:58:28.234 --> 01:58:30.002
Lagi dimasukin terekam jelas, lho.

01:58:34.841 --> 01:58:35.842
Kesal, ya?

01:58:51.958 --> 01:58:53.025
Mau kulihatkan lebih jelas lagi?

01:58:55.294 --> 01:58:56.295
Cepat rekam.

01:59:16.682 --> 01:59:19.585
Cepat rekam. Pas lagi masuk terekam jelas, tuh.

02:00:06.098 --> 02:00:07.099
Sekarang gantian.

02:00:11.370 --> 02:00:12.605
Ada di dekatmu, kan.

02:00:23.115 --> 02:00:24.116
Ayo cepat.

02:00:44.103 --> 02:00:45.571
Rekam temanmu pas lagi keenakan.

02:00:47.340 --> 02:00:48.341
Ulurkan tanganmu.

02:00:49.408 --> 02:00:50.409
Rekam yang benar.

02:01:43.929 --> 02:01:44.930
Tadi di dalam, kan.

02:01:47.533 --> 02:01:48.934
Tenanglah.

02:01:50.069 --> 02:01:51.237
Ayo, rekam.

02:01:52.471 --> 02:01:53.472
Turunkan tanganmu.

02:02:47.093 --> 02:02:48.427
Rekam, dong.

02:03:24.830 --> 02:03:25.831
Kita ke ranjang.

02:03:27.833 --> 02:03:28.834
Bawa saja.

02:03:31.303 --> 02:03:32.304
Sini.

02:03:50.189 --> 02:03:51.257
Goyangkan pinggulmu.

02:03:57.296 --> 02:03:58.297
Cepat rekam.

02:04:02.701 --> 02:04:03.836
Cepat goyang.

02:04:06.038 --> 02:04:07.473
Kau lagi ngapain?

02:04:07.807 --> 02:04:08.808
Sini.

02:04:10.643 --> 02:04:11.644
Cepat hentikan.

02:04:13.712 --> 02:04:15.080
Cepat goyangkan pinggulmu.

02:04:15.881 --> 02:04:16.882
Kau tahu, kan?

02:04:27.426 --> 02:04:28.427
Sini.

02:04:30.696 --> 02:04:31.697
Hentikan yang benar.

02:04:38.370 --> 02:04:39.371
Sini.

02:04:48.447 --> 02:04:51.917
Jalan lebih cepat.

02:05:13.372 --> 02:05:14.874
Kau sedang apa?

02:05:16.976 --> 02:05:17.977
Buat aku merasa enak.

02:05:34.527 --> 02:05:37.229
Perlihatkan pantat dan dadamu.

02:05:39.231 --> 02:05:40.866
Jangan tutupi perutmu.

02:05:44.203 --> 02:05:45.204
Busungkan perutmu.

02:05:45.671 --> 02:05:46.672
Biar kelihatan.

02:05:47.206 --> 02:05:48.207
Cepat.

02:05:49.942 --> 02:05:50.943
Diam di situ.

02:05:55.581 --> 02:05:56.582
Goyangkan pinggulmu.

02:06:07.893 --> 02:06:11.463
Cepat goyangkan pinggulmu. Keluarkan suara nakal dan rapatkan perutmu.

02:06:36.388 --> 02:06:37.389
Teruslah bergerak meski kupukul.

02:06:37.723 --> 02:06:38.691
Goyangkan lagi pinggulmu.

02:06:55.874 --> 02:06:57.343
Teruslah bergoyang sampai kau klimaks.

02:06:58.911 --> 02:06:59.912
Sudahlah, goyangkan saja.

02:07:08.721 --> 02:07:09.722
Cepat.

02:07:47.159 --> 02:07:49.194
Mulai terasa enak, nih.

02:08:07.212 --> 02:08:08.213
Jangan tidur.

02:08:08.380 --> 02:08:09.381
Goyangkan pinggulmu.

02:08:10.683 --> 02:08:11.650
Woi.

02:08:12.618 --> 02:08:13.619
Santai saja.

02:08:14.053 --> 02:08:15.187
Teruskan.

02:08:42.314 --> 02:08:43.315
Ayo.

02:08:44.083 --> 02:08:45.084
Buka perutnya, ya.

02:08:50.222 --> 02:08:51.223
Tu...

02:08:57.696 --> 02:08:59.198
...h, lihat. Dia tidur nyenyak.

02:10:15.107 --> 02:10:18.076
Tadi lucu banget. Perutku sampai sakit.

02:10:41.333 --> 02:10:42.734
Hasilnya bagus, ya.

02:10:45.737 --> 02:10:46.772
Mau dipakai buat apa, ya?
